# 🧑‍💻 14. Good Prompts for a JavaScript Learner

### 📚 Concept Explanation

```text
I am a beginner learning JavaScript.
Explain objects in simple language.
Give 3 examples and one practice question.
```

### 🧠 Logic

```text
Explain the logic behind this program
step by step.
Don't rewrite the code.
```

### 💡 Hint

```text
I am solving this JavaScript problem.
Give me one hint, but don't give me the solution.
```

### 🐛 Debugging

```text
Here is my JavaScript code.

[code]

The output is different from what I expected.
Help me identify the logical mistake.
Don't rewrite the entire program.
```

### 🔎 Verification

```text
Check whether my reasoning is correct.
If it is wrong, explain exactly where my reasoning fails.
```

